# Local development values for the Misaka Cloudflare Gateway.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in. These declare WHICH values a
# Gateway deployment needs; the committed file carries NO real values.
# Obtain each from the target Network (out of band). The Network Authority
# PRIVATE key is never here, and never deployed to a Gateway.
NETWORK_ID=
NETWORK_AUTHORITY_PUBLIC_KEY=
